  "description": "Since childhood, I have been warned that the sins of my past life have marked me as prey for beasts. Dismissing the warning as nonsense, I never gave it much thought until strange, unsettling dreams involving my longtime childhood friend and a mysterious boarder begin to blur the line between suspicion and desire. Now, I must figure out which of the two is the beast my grandmother warned me about.\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000082254)",
